    "$description": "Themed native scrollbars, used by the ScrollArea component and any consumer that opts into `scrollbar-width`/`::-webkit-scrollbar-*` theming. Thumb alpha is tuned so the resolved thumb-on-surface contrast clears WCAG 1.4.11 (3:1) over common surfaces.",
