      "$description": "8 categorical chart colors retuned for the indigo brand. Solved so the set is brand-safe (no hue in 248-292), mutually distinguishable in normal vision (min CIEDE2000 dE00 >= 12 in both arms), and carries a minimum pairwise CIE L* separation >= 4 in each arm as a secondary distinguishing channel for colour-vision-deficient viewers. Every color is in sRGB gamut, chroma >= 0.06, and >= 3:1 on its theme's chart background. Light and dark arms are tuned independently for in-theme contrast and gamut, so a series is not guaranteed the same hue across themes.",
